    "q-49063": {
      "dom_id": "step-q49063",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Calculate $\\int \\sqrt{x}(2+x)\\,\\text{d}x.$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\sqrt{x}(2+x)\\text{d}x & =\\int {x}^{1/2}(2+x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (2{x}^{1/2}+{x}^{3/2})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int {x}^{1/2}\\text{d}x+\\int {x}^{3/2}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2(\\frac{2{x}^{3/2}}{3})+(\\frac{2{x}^{5/2}}{5})+C \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{{x}^{5}}}{5}+\\frac{4\\sqrt{{x}^{3}}}{3}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
